3
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:16.610
Unit sixteen: Energy Diplomacy. Today you will link causes and results with owing to, thereby and thus.

4
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.585
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:23.662
