13
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:54.349
Oil dependency leaves economies exposed to price shocks.

14
00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.869
Your turn. Say: Oil dependency.

15
00:01:00.733 --> 00:01:02.222
Oil dependency.

16
00:01:02.983 --> 00:01:04.820
Renewable energy transition.

17
00:01:05.817 --> 00:01:12.472
Renewable energy transition means the shift from fossil fuels to sun, wind and other clean sources.

18
00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:16.569
The renewable energy transition is changing trade routes.

19
00:01:17.183 --> 00:01:21.136
Your turn. Say: Renewable energy transition.

20
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.464
Renewable energy transition.

21
00:01:27.217 --> 00:01:28.543
Energy exporter.

22
00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:34.115
Energy exporter means a country that sells oil, gas or electricity abroad.

23
00:01:34.717 --> 00:01:37.343
The energy exporter signed a long contract.

24
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:40.684
Your turn. Say: Energy exporter.

25
00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:45.115
Energy exporter.

26
00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.629
Pipeline politics.

27
00:01:48.617 --> 00:01:53.287
Pipeline politics means the use of energy pipelines as tools of political power.

28
00:01:53.883 --> 00:01:56.754
