Energy crisis means a serious shortage or price shock in energy supplies.

33
00:02:14.483 --> 00:02:17.435
An energy crisis forced factories to close.

34
00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:21.364
Your turn. Say: Energy crisis.

35
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.816
Energy crisis.

36
00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.097
Strategic reserve.

37
00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:33.370
Strategic reserve means a stock of fuel that a government keeps for emergencies.

38
00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:36.877
The strategic reserve covered three months of demand.

39
00:02:37.483 --> 00:02:40.565
Your turn. Say: Strategic reserve.

40
